      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The realization that the prize was not what you thought it was can be a crushing blow. Some people are able to find new purpose and meaning, even in the face of a concluded chapter, by exploring new passions, rediscovering old ones, or finding ways to make a positive impact in their community. Others may take time to mourn the loss of the identity and sense of fulfillment that came with the pursuit. Either way, it's okay to acknowledge the emotional weight of this transition.",
